{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/574118-has-anyone-else-had-issues-with-the-quality-of-their-werewolf-book-from-drivethru","id":574118,"title":"Has anyone else had issues with the quality of their Werewolf book from DriveThru?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-30T11:29:41-07:00","id":574118,"title":"Has anyone else had issues with the quality of their Werewolf book from DriveThru?","content":"So far I have gotten the WoD Core Book, Blood and Smoke, God Machine Chronicle, and Demon: the Descent from DriveThru in the standard hardcover quality and they have all been really nice quality books. I recently received my copy of the Werewolf: The Forsaken that was ordered in the same quality but the book is a little iffy in comparison. The spine of the book and the corners of the cover are all a little lumpy/formless like they weren't really well applied to the heavy card underneath. Also the pages of the book are cut about about 1/8'' shorter than all the others WoD books along the edge opposite the spine. That means the cover extends out strangely far past the edge of the book and kinda gets in the way when you are trying to flip through it.<br /> <br /> These aren't issues that are going to make send the book back to DriveThru for a replacement, but they were noticeable enough that they struck me immediately as I took the the book out of the shipping package. I'd be interested to see if anyone else has noticed similar issues?<br /> <br /> (As a side note it's too bad that W:tF doesn't have nice borders like the other WoD books, its pages are so white)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T10:42:29-07:00","id":581201,"title":"","content":"My concern was the coarse paper used in the premium edition, my other premium PoD books had a heavier glossy paper. It's better than the standard edition pages (thicker and more opaque) but not as nice looking (or feeling) as my other WoD cores. Still perfectly legible though, and without the cover edge issue you described.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T18:43:49-07:00","id":581794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/574118-has-anyone-else-had-issues-with-the-quality-of-their-werewolf-book-from-drivethru?p=581201#post581201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My concern was the coarse paper used in the premium edition, my other premium PoD books had a heavier glossy paper. It's better than the standard edition pages (thicker and more opaque) but not as nice looking (or feeling) as my other WoD cores. Still perfectly legible though, and without the cover edge issue you described.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I hadn't particularly noticed the paper being different but upon inspection I can tell the difference, not quite as crisp and smooth as the other books but only slightly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T23:14:24-07:00","id":586840,"title":"","content":"I'm being nitpicky, I was hoping there would be more of a visual pop to the color images. My pdf copy on my kindle looks pretty sharp and has that pop, so I really don't have much to complain about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T12:47:44-07:00","id":591640,"title":"","content":"I'm with Darksider. I ordered the Premium expecting it to use the glossy paper, not the matte paper from the black and white books. Had I known that it didn't have the gloss, I would have saved myself the money and ordered standard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5309-chancetr","name":"ChanceTR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5309_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T20:23:31-07:00","id":592254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChanceTR</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/574118-has-anyone-else-had-issues-with-the-quality-of-their-werewolf-book-from-drivethru?p=591640#post591640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm with Darksider. I ordered the Premium expecting it to use the glossy paper, not the matte paper from the black and white books. Had I known that it didn't have the gloss, I would have saved myself the money and ordered standard.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Standard ones are even more desaturated/dull though so be careful, next time you pick up a Onyx Path book on drive-thru check in the description, there is usually a link to two images that show the difference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-16T12:42:26-07:00","id":593026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/574118-has-anyone-else-had-issues-with-the-quality-of-their-werewolf-book-from-drivethru?p=581201#post581201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My concern was the coarse paper used in the premium edition, my other premium PoD books had a heavier glossy paper. It's better than the standard edition pages (thicker and more opaque) but not as nice looking (or feeling) as my other WoD cores. Still perfectly legible though, and without the cover edge issue you described.</div> </div> </div> </div>You should bring this issue up with DTRPG as a consumer. All premium books should use the same paper, which is thicker and holds the color better than the standard (which if I recall correctly is the same paper stock as the b&amp;w). And none of those PoD paper stocks are what I or DTRPG consider &quot;glossy&quot;, but that might be subjective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-16T13:06:54-07:00","id":593067,"title":"","content":"Edit; &quot;glossy' wasn't the right word to use.<br /> <br /> Like I said in the follow up, it's being really nitpicky on my part. I just did another side by side check with my GMC premium, Demon Standard and Forsaken premium. The GMC pages have the best tactile feel, Forsaken is really close but when turning pages the back side of each page feels rougher than the front, which is different from the way the GMC pages feel. The best way I can describe the difference in images is that images on the smoother front side are like a fresh tattoo, while on the rougher back side it's like that same tattoo had a week to heal (and the difference isn't that pronounced, I just don't have a better analogy to use). Print legibility is the same on both sides.<br /> <br /> I did some further reading to see what might cause the difference since the paper stock is obviously the same, it looks like a variance in the finishing process of the raw paper would account for that difference in feel between the books. I had an OCD moment and needed to research a lot further, learned more about paper than I will ever need to know. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":11,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","user":"Darksider","date":". 07-16-2015, 04:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-17T06:02:57-07:00","id":593735,"title":"","content":"My W20 book had started to rip in between the side of the spine and the first page of the binding. Most likely from bouncing around in shipping. I took it as educational about the weight of that much paper held in place in such a manner, and reinforced the bindings a bit. Then I went back and did so on V20 and the other books I've got that are as massive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T17:55:41-07:00","id":595177,"title":"","content":"That's something you should send an email to DTRPG about, I've never had a binding problem with any of my POD stuff from them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":